  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combatting IUU Fishing and Promoting Sustainable Fisheries in Southeast Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program supports enhanced regional cooperation and strengthened monitoring, control and surveillance capabilities to combat illegal, unreported and unregulated (IUU) fishing, as well as improved gender inclusivity in fisheries management.</narrative>
